Health Care Data Analysis Dashboard

This project features an interactive, end-to-end data analytics dashboard designed to monitor, track, and analyze clinical and financial metrics within healthcare operations. Built using Power BI, the dashboard synthesizes complex patient tracking, hospital performance, and financial data into dynamic, actionable insights for healthcare administrators and clinical decision-makers.
##🚀 Key Features & Insights#
#Financial Oversight: Real-time tracking of total project costs ($1.4B+), average hospital stay costs, and insurance provider distributions.
#Operational Metrics: Deep-dive analysis into patient volume, admission types (Urgent, Emergency, Elective), and historical admission trends from 2019 to 2024.
#Clinical Demographics: Granular breakdown of patient age groups, gender ratios, frequent medications (Aspirin, Ibuprofen), and medical conditions.
# Provider Performance: Rankings of the top 10 most visited healthcare facilities and patient volume distribution across major insurance carriers (Aetna, Blue Cross, Cigna, etc.).
Advanced Filtering: Built-in dynamic slicers to seamlessly filter the entire dataset by medical condition, admission/discharge years, test results, and specific medications.
